        ('90010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028', v_class9_id, 'Class 9 Science Kendriya Vidyalaya (KVS) National Paper - Set 40', 180, 80, 0.00, false, 'Science', 'KVS_NVS', 'Class 9', 'Time Allowed: 3 Hours (180 Minutes). Maximum Marks: 80. This question paper consists of 39 questions in 5 sections (A to E). Section A (1-20): 1 Mark each; Section B (21-26): 2 Marks each; Section C (27-33): 3 Marks each; Section D (34-36): 5 Marks each; Section E (37-39): 4 Marks each.', 'CBSE Science 80M: Sec A (20x1M), Sec B (6x2M), Sec C (7x3M), Sec D (3x5M), Sec E (3x4M) - Total 39 Qs'),
